      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「一番下の階を、見ていただきたいのです」強敵戦を前に、部屋からの申し出だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "案内の階段は長く、下るほど内装が古くなっていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大理石が石壁に、シャンデリアが松明に。迷宮だった頃の彼だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "最下層です。……私の、最初の部屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "攻略者の皆様が、宝を目指して降りてきた頃の、最終フロアです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "room-seventeen.power.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "room-seventeen.power.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最下層は、綺麗に片付いていた。宝箱の台座は空で、埃ひとつない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "台座の隣に、場違いなものが大切そうに飾ってあった。片方だけの、靴下。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "最後の攻略者の、落とし物です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あの方は宝を取って、笑って、帰っていきました。「また来るよ」と。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……それきり、誰も、来ていません。私の物語は、あの日、終わったのだと思います。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誤出口の癖の、根っこを見た気がした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「また来るよ」を信じて待ち続けた建築は、帰り道を作るたび、あの日の後ろ姿を思い出す。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ですが、今日お見せしたいのは、思い出ではなく——力の方です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "この最下層が開いている時、私は、本気が出せます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "flash"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "床が透けて、下に無数の廊下が見えた。百二十階は、上物にすぎない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "地下には、迷宮時代の全フロアが、今も生きて畳まれている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼の本気は、全部を一瞬で「生やす」力だった。会場の地下に、丸ごと一個の迷宮を。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "同行の新人くんは、廊下の数を数えようとして三十秒で挫折。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "記録板に「そこ、ぜんぶ、へや。」と書いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日も、完璧な監査だと思う。耳が、笑いをこらえて震えた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ひとつ、聞いてもいいですか。この最下層、今まで誰かに見せたこと、ありますか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "初めてです。最下層は、攻略の最終地点なので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……辿り着いた方に、しか。あなたは、階段で普通に来てしまいましたが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……それも、悪くないものですね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.power.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それから、力の使い方の相談に入った。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "room-seventeen.power.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "room-seventeen.power.choice.001",
          "label": "閉ざされた最深階を、本人の内側から開く",
          "result": "型の名前は「開館」、合図で会場の床に迷宮の入口が咲く。相手は戦うか迷うかもてなされるかの三択。初リハーサルの模擬相手は私で、三分で温泉階に誘導された。強い。たぶん最強の部類。",
          "intent": "迷宮時代の全力を、今の彼の形で出す",
          "promise": "失敗時の危険を引き受け、この人専用の成長を最大まで進める。",
          "memory": "型「開館」の初リハーサルの敗因(温泉)を、私は認めたくない。",
          "tone": "heroic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
